  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Considering Design Updates**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the frontend design aspects, specifically addressing a request to enhance a 2D arcade game. The primary areas for improvement are the visuals: background, sprites, and overall graphics, as well as the audio. I\'m prioritizing these elements to breathe new life into the game.\n\n\n**Analyzing Design Approach**\n\nI\'ve been analyzing the design approach, focusing on enhancing the game\'s visuals and audio. I\'m prioritizing the game background, sprites, and overall graphics, as well as the audio aspects of the game. I\'m consulting relevant skill documents for frontend design, specifically `SKILL.md` and `4_games_2d_casual.md`. I\'m carefully considering the use of generated imagery versus offscreen-cached canvas paintings.\n\n\n"
