  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Verifying Simulation Details**\n\nI\'m now diving into the engine\'s specifics at `/src/game/engine.ts`, checking every detail to ensure everything functions as anticipated. I\'m focusing on confirming the 60fps decoupled simulation. I\'m aiming for high fidelity and smooth playback of events.\n\n\n**Analyzing Engine Logic**\n\nI\'ve discovered the engine cleverly separates continuous inputs from edge-triggered actions, ensuring snappy gameplay. Notably, the use of `requestAnimationFrame` outside React enhances performance. I\'m especially impressed by the Title Screen\'s live-world backdrop. The periodic showcasing of diverse locations, complete with floating bubbles, is a brilliant touch. The combo and hitstop feel is also taking shape.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "xwMGa96ZMeT_vdIPxuiVoQ8"
